<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</link><description>爱荷华州一家工厂的不稳定爆炸物清除工作一年多前就开始了，但当时尚未完成，为周三有争议的爆炸埋下了伏笔。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html'&gt;有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Army Knew Much Earlier of the Explosive Risk in Iowa, Evidence Suggests&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:50:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>爱荷华州爆炸后，一家人聚集在一起度过一个不寻常的感恩节</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html</link><description>一家弹药厂爆炸后的第二天，一家人聚集在爱荷华州东南部的一座农舍里。感觉就像一场暴风雨过去了。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html'&gt;爱荷华州爆炸后，一家人聚集在一起度过一个不寻常的感恩节&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：After the Iowa Detonation, a Family Gathered for an Unusual Thanksgiving&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:33:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纽约感恩节游行气球泄气</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html</link><description>梅西百货感恩节游行因强风暴而推迟后，工作人员通宵工作，在恶劣天气到来之前给气球放气。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html'&gt;纽约感恩节游行气球泄气&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Thanksgiving Parade Balloons Are Deflated in New York&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>梅西百货感恩节游行颠覆了计划并增加了游行乐队的成本</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-marching-bands.html</link><description>九支游行乐队将在梅西百货感恩节游行中表演。将活动移至周六的决定给他们带来了新的后勤挑战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-marching-bands.html'&gt;梅西百货感恩节游行颠覆了计划并增加了游行乐队的成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade Upends Plans and Adds Costs for Marching Bands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-marching-bands.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:21:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纽约人和游客试图挽救因大雨而推迟的游行日</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html</link><description>风和雨使通常在感恩节天空中占据主导地位的受人喜爱的气球停飞，周四游行路线沿线的街道大多空无一人。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html'&gt;纽约人和游客试图挽救因大雨而推迟的游行日&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New Yorkers and Tourists Try to Salvage a Parade Day Postponed by Rain&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:53:41 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>